WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.275
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Confidence Builder.

00:00:12.275 --> 00:00:16.549
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.114
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.114 --> 00:00:21.679
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:29.373
Confidence is not something you are born with. It is something you build.

00:00:29.373 --> 00:00:37.068
You build it the way you build a tower: one small try at a time.

00:00:37.068 --> 00:00:42.197
Every try is a brick — even the tries that wobble, even the tries that don't work yet.

00:00:42.197 --> 00:00:45.617
You can do this with eyes closed, or eyes open, looking softly at your desk.

00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:54.166
Think of one time you tried something hard. Learning to ride, or read, or tie your shoes.

00:00:54.166 --> 00:01:00.151
At first it was hard. And you tried. Maybe you tried more than once.

00:01:00.151 --> 00:01:07.845
That trying was you, building. Brick by brick, try by try.

00:01:07.845 --> 00:01:16.395
You do not need to be the best at it. The trying is the building.

00:01:16.395 --> 00:01:25.799
Now pick one small brave try for today. Small is good. Small is how towers start.

00:01:25.799 --> 00:01:30.929
It might be raising your hand. Or trying the hard problem. Or saying hello to someone new.

00:01:30.929 --> 00:01:36.913
Picture yourself making that one small try, like setting one brick gently in place.

00:01:36.913 --> 00:01:42.043
It does not have to go perfectly. The try itself is the brick.

00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:48.027
Your tower grows every time you try. It goes where you go, all day long.

00:01:48.027 --> 00:01:54.867
That is Confidence Builder. Confidence is built, one small try at a time.

00:01:54.867 --> 00:01:57.432
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:57.432 --> 00:02:00.851
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:00.851 --> 00:02:04.271
You're ready for what's next.
